warning[G008]: adds up a number that can't be added
 --> models/marts/account_totals.sql:1:20
  |
1 | select account_id, sum(balance) as total_balance
  |                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^ adds balance from different snapshot_date values
  |
 ::: models/sources.yml
  |
  = balance is declared a stock over snapshot_date
  |
  = note: balance is a level at each snapshot_date, like an account balance; adding several snapshot_date values counts the same amount once per snapshot_date
  = help: group by snapshot_date, or keep one snapshot_date per group (such as the latest) before summing
  = see: cardinal explain G008

