 3 |     sum(revenue_to_date) as total_to_date,
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ adds running totals from different order_date values
   |
  ::: models/intermediate/running_revenue.sql:11:5
   |
11 |     sum(revenue) over (partition by currency order by order_date) as revenue_to_date
   |     ------------ a running total over order_date
   |
   = note: each row's revenue_to_date already includes the rows before it, so adding rows from several order_date values counts those rows again
   = help: add up the underlying values per (currency) instead, or keep only the last order_date of each group
